# Implementation plan — Spec 1.11.4

## Summary

Add a **Pages** top-level tab to the UI Kit showcase with nested **List page** and **Details page** demos that compose existing `@webonone/ui-kit` primitives the way production admin screens do. Prefer reuse — no new package components unless a hard gap blocks the demo.

See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-pages-tab-showcase.md](./02-pages-tab-showcase.md).

| Project | Touch |
|---------|--------|
| `ui-kit/showcase/` | Tab registry, `PagesPage`, List/Details compositions |
| `ui-kit/package/` | Only if an export gap appears while composing |

