## Phase 1 — Pages tab + List / Details demos

**Goal:** [02-pages-tab-showcase.md](./02-pages-tab-showcase.md) — register Pages; nested List / Details; full compositions with mock data.

**Exit criteria:** `#pages` works; List and Details nested tabs work; list/details building-block checklists satisfied; type-check passes.

| Task | Paths / detail |
|------|----------------|
| Register tab | `ui-kit/showcase/src/components/showcase-nav.ts` — add `{ id: 'pages', label: 'Pages' }` |
| Wire host | `ui-kit/showcase/src/pages/ShowcaseApp.tsx` — `<Tabs.Content value="pages">` |
| Pages host | `ui-kit/showcase/src/pages/PagesPage.tsx` — nested Radix Tabs `list` / `details` (default `list`) |
| Optional modules | `ListPageDemo.tsx` / `DetailsPageDemo.tsx` under `showcase/src/pages/` or colocated |
| Hash | Ensure `#pages`; extend `parseShowcaseTab` for `#pages-list` / `#pages-details` if straightforward |
| List composition | `FeaturePage` + `ListSearchField` + `ListFilterTrigger`/`ListFilterPanel` + `ListPageBody` + `ItemList*` (menu, active, empty) + `Pagination` (`pageSize` 12, options `[12, 24, 48]`) |
| List data | In-memory mock array (≥ enough rows to paginate); search/filter reset page to 1 |
| Details composition | `FeaturePage` + Save/Cancel actions + `Form`/`FormField` + `Input`, `Textarea`, `Select`, `Checkbox`, `Switch`, `Button`; ≥1 inline field error |
| Imports | `@webonone/ui-kit` + local `DemoSection` only — no service stores/APIs |

**Reference:** Components tab sections in `ComponentsPage.tsx` (item-lists, list-filters, pagination, layout); production list pattern e.g. Email/Data FeaturePage + ListPageBody.

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w ui-kit-root` · manual `npm run dev:ui-kit` → Pages → List / Details

