## Risks and open items

- Nested deep-links (`#pages-list` / `#pages-details`) are nice-to-have; `#pages` + nested tab state is acceptable
- Do not invent a new `DetailPage` layout unless composition proves a shared shell gap
- Avoid thinning Components list demos unless Pages demos are complete and redundancy is clear
- Status string for ClickUp is **`planed`** (list spelling)

